ile download and result code buttons and updating instructions when auto submission is active.\n","Target":"### Non-Major (Patch 1.0.13)\n- Added an 'Auto Record Quiz' setting toggle button placeholder inside the Quiz Options slide-out drawer in `teacher.html` with the description 'Record submissions instead of downloading file or base64 conversion'.\n- Implemented visual toggle state behavior without attaching background functional logic or modifying the quiz submission payload.\n- Why: User requested adding the 'auto record quiz instead of downloading file or base 64 conversion' option button placeholder in teacher settings with no functional backend integration.\n"}}]}
